  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9541d86e2fd84c1d9990edf0852d74ab, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshPro
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Firearms (behind you and on the right-hand table)

    Grip grabs. Trigger fires. Guns start empty.

    Seat a magazine and release it, then rack the slide, bolt, or pump.

    Other hand on the foregrip braces. Pull the moving part to cycle.

    Shotgun: push a red TEMPORARY shell into the port, then pump.

    Other hand''s trigger on the gold selector switches SEMI / AUTO.

    Shot sounds are temporary synthesized clicks. No firearm audio in the project.

    Headset rig checks (RIG_VALIDATION section 3) are still open.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
